            <h2 class="cs-font_36 mb-4">Market overview</h2>
              <p><strong>India</strong> exported approximately USD 8 billion in digital marketing services in 2024, dominated by large agencies in Bangalore, Delhi, Mumbai, and Pune. The market is mature with hundreds of agencies serving Fortune 500 clients.</p>
              <p><strong>Pakistan</strong> exported approximately USD 3.5 billion in IT-and-digital services in 2024 (including marketing as a subset), concentrated in Karachi, Lahore, Islamabad, and Rawalpindi. The market is smaller but growing faster (~25% YoY).</p>
